/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is committed — zipp-lang ships a binary (the `zipp` CLI), so a
# locked dependency set keeps builds reproducible.


# Generated wasm-bindgen glue for the node harnesses (see crates/zipp-wasm/tests/node/README.md)
crates/zipp-wasm/tests/node/pkg/

# Python bytecode cache from tools/ (bench.py is imported by test_bench.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Agent worktrees and session state
.claude/
